摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH Remote · 口袋里的 DSH 控制台 会话 · 审批 · 提问 · 文件传输，局域网 / Tailscale 直连 多服务器自动选优，聊天记录离线可看 带 Token 鉴权，数据只在你的设备之间流动 Sessions · approvals · questions · file transfer over LAN / Tailscale. Automatic fastest-server selection. Chat history available offline. Token-authenticated — your data fl","id":"gh:1334902330","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-Remote","slug":"Blank-not-black/dsh-Remote","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","mobile","remote-control"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH Remote · 口袋里的 DSH 控制台 会话 · 审批 · 提问 · 文件传输，局域网 / Tailscale 直连 多服务器自动选优，聊天记录离线可看 带 Token 鉴权，数据只在你的"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"设备之间流动 Sessions · approvals · questions · file transfer over LAN / Tailscale. Automatic fastest-serv"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"er selection. Chat history available offline. Token-authenticated — your data fl"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Remote"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Continue your DSH work from a phone or another computer: read sessions, answer approvals and quest"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ions, transfer files, and inspect the host."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"DSH Remote consists of a DSH plugin, a single-file gateway, and clients. The plugin adds the DSH ent"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ry point and manages the gateway. The gateway handles authentication, HTTP/realtime proxying, and fi"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"les. Clients include Android, mobile/desktop WebUI, and the HarmonyOS source project."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Documentation · Installation · Troubleshooting · Downloads · Issues"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"For task-based instructions and AI-assisted diagnosis, use the operation and troubleshooting knowled"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ge base (Chinese) or the AI reading index. The plugin includes the same knowledge base as offline Do"},{"id":"p7s3","text":") or the AI reading index. The plugin includes the same knowledge base as offline Doctor references."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The detailed guides are currently in Chinese. This page and the plugin README provide an English ove"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"rview and installation path."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The current source is **0.8.0-rc.9** (2026-10-22), a candidate for validation before the stable rele"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ase. See the rc.9 notes for scope and evidence; a local candidate does not establish npm or GitHub r"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"elease availability."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Capabilities"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Area | Features |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Sessions | History and realtime messages, model/reasoning selection, approvals, questions, goals, "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"queues, subagents and turn branches |\n| Learning and diagnosis | Eight-step mobile guide, read-only "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"AI diagnosis, local operation logs and feedback |\n| Files and images | Host browsing, previews, down"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"loads, resumable chunks and image attachments |\n| Host status | Gateway/DSH status, mux/host channel"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"s, devices, tokens and cost estimates |\n| Plugins | Installed/discovered plugins, details, configura"},{"id":"p12s6","text":"tion toggles and operation records |\n| Session insights | Optional dsh-context summaries and dsh-cos"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"t-meter costs/quotas |\n| Weak networks and recovery | Independent long polling, WS backoff, local hi"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"story, gzip/ETag and bounded crash recovery |\n| Connections and themes | Multiple pairing addresses,"},{"id":"p12s9","text":" groups, LAN/Tailscale and six Web themes; Blue Fat Fish is the default |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Mobile navigation is **Sessions, Files, More**. The session home shows workspaces, recent sessions a"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"nd items needing attention. More groups host connections, plugins, receipts and preferences. Desktop"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" uses the same three entry points with a wider conversation layout. See platform differences."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The mobile guide teaches connection, chat, files, branches, diagnosis and feedback. Finishing or ski"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"pping the entire guide removes its home invitation; reopen it at **More → Preferences and maintenanc"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"e → Getting started**. Blue Fat Fish applies when no valid theme is saved; existing selections are p"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ng started**. Blue Fat Fish applies when no valid theme is saved; existing selections are preserved."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Image understanding depends on DSH and the model. Cost estimates do not replace provider bills. Insi"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ghts require the corresponding host plugins and display unavailable states when data is missing. DSH"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" UI renders a safe read-only subset."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Quick start: DSH Web plugin"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Confirm that DSH Web works, then run as the same user:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. Fully restart DSH Web, hard-refresh with Ctrl+F5, and use the left navigation's More → 手机连接（DSH R"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"emote） to open pairing in a browser. A first-use card explains where to find it; older hosts keep a "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"bottom-left connection button.\n2. Confirm the gateway is running and open `http://127.0.0.1:8787/hea"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"lth` on the host.\n3. Generate a connection QR in the plugin wizard or admin console and scan it in M"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"ore → Hosts and connections → Scan to connect. The APK download QR only installs the app.\n4. For man"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"ual pairing, use `http://PC-LAN-IP:8787` and the token. A phone's localhost refers to the phone."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The example targets the `web` profile; use your actual profile name. DSH Desktop uses its own plugin"},{"id":"p20s2","text":" manager and requires a complete exit/reopen. Installing into Web does not install into Desktop. For"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" a published candidate, use its exact `@<version>`; check npm before relying on `@next` or `@latest`"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"a published candidate, use its exact `@<version>`; check npm before relying on `@next` or `@latest`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"For standalone gateways, multiple addresses, pinned versions and Git-source installation, see the in"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"stallation guide. A standalone executable can run with `--supervise`; defaults are `0.0.0.0:8787` an"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"d upstream `http://127.0.0.1:3080`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"> Pairing QR codes contain credentials. Use a trusted LAN or Tailscale; keep tokens private and avoi"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"d directly exposing the gateway to the public Internet."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Captured on 2026-10-22: **rc.9 mobile WebUI** with an isolated test host and sample data, showing th"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e default fish skin and the updated More page. These are browser captures, not Android device captur"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"es. Older emulator, desktop and admin images remain in the screenshot archive with provenance."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Downloads and platform status"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Releases lists versions; Latest is the stable entry point. RCs are separate validation releases."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| Platform | Distribution |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Android | `dsh-remote.apk`, Capacitor shell; permissions and device behavior need device validatio"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"n |\n| Windows x64 | `dsh-remote-win-x64.exe`, no separate Node installation |\n| Linux x64 | `dsh-rem"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ote-linux-x64`, grant executable permission |\n| Browser | Connect to the gateway for mobile/desktop "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"WebUI |\n| HarmonyOS | ArkTS/ArkUI source; build and sign yourself; current release CI does not build"},{"id":"p28s5","text":" HAPs |\n| macOS Apple Silicon | CI is configured to build `dsh-remote-macos-arm64`, ad-hoc sign it a"},{"id":"p28s6","text":"nd run an isolated startup smoke check; no Apple notarization. Intel uses the plugin or source; see "},{"id":"p28s7","text":"ated startup smoke check; no Apple notarization. Intel uses the plugin or source; see installation |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Documentation describes repository **0.8.0-rc.9 on 2026-10-22**. HarmonyOS still declares **0.6.26**"},{"id":"p29s2","text":". Check actual release attachments separately from build configuration; this page does not claim tha"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"t public distribution or all device acceptance checks are complete."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
